<title>LITHUANIA: C.BANK REGISTERS LITIMPEX SHARE CAPITAL BOOST.</title>
<headline>C.BANK REGISTERS LITIMPEX SHARE CAPITAL BOOST.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania said on Thursday it registered a 60 million litas share capital boost by Litimpex Bank.</p>
<p>The boost brings Litimpex's official share capital up to 64 million litas from four million litas, with the majority of the new shares going to foreign investors, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
